1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:30,070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

3
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 28= (This drama does not correspond)

5
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:53,079
I rest my head on the pillow you slept on,

8
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:57,079
sleep on the mattress you just slept on,

9
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,519
and cover myself with the quilt you just used.

10
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,239
So I suppose...

11
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,919
we've shared a bed after all.

12
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:14,380
♪Your shimmering gaze♪

13
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:18,460
♪Keeps stirring the tides of fate♪

14
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,620
♪The graceful waves♪

15
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:23,500
♪Sway gently to and fro♪

16
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:27,380
♪Yet my heart is caught in the flurry♪

17
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:30,100
♪Ooh, you fall into my heart♪

18
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:34,940
♪There are still many chapters ahead♪

19
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:38,479
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

20
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:40,639
Nanny Zhang, wipe down the pillars, too.

21
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:41,680
All right.

22
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:46,199
The fallen leaves. Make sure you sweep them up properly.

23
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,280
Young Master had this specially made for Young Madam.

24
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:01,000
Today is your first day as a newlywed.

25
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,180
You'll be meeting the elders.

26
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:04,719
This is both elegant and dignified.

27
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:10,439
It's so heavy.

28
00:03:11,256 --> 00:03:12,680
It'll be hard to kowtow in this.

29
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,479
My parents had this specially made for me.

30
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,000
It's hollow inside.

31
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:27,199
It looks beautiful and is light to wear.

32
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:30,960
It looks lovely.

33
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:47,230
After the Shence Garrison winter clothing case,

34
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,830
the late Emperor bestowed a silver squirrel pelt on Young Master.

35
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,700
Young Master kept it all this time and never let anyone use it.

36
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:54,240
Now he's had it specially made into a fur coat for you.

37
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:56,680
It's warm and beautiful.

38
00:04:01,590 --> 00:04:04,460
This is your first time paying respects to the elders after the wedding.

39
00:04:04,472 --> 00:04:06,560
Would this be too plain?

40
00:04:06,856 --> 00:04:09,352
The silver squirrel coat Young Master prepared would be better.

41
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:10,840
I'll wear this one.

42
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:24,560
This coat may look plain,

43
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:27,399
but your mother sewed every stitch of it by hand.

44
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:30,199
For a daughter to wear it is an expression of filial devotion.

45
00:04:30,216 --> 00:04:31,920
When Old Master and First Madam see it,

46
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,199
I'm sure they'll be pleased, too.

47
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,439
Xiaolian is right.

48
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,519
I wasn't thinking clearly.

49
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,580
It's been over a year since we last met.

50
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:47,920
Even Xiaolian is sounding quite learned now.

51
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:51,160
Yuchan has taught you well.

52
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:57,079
Unfortunately, Baogai learned the most.

53
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,560
I came second.

54
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,160
Xiaolian did the worst.

55
00:05:28,959 --> 00:05:29,399
My lady.

56
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:30,519
Please.

57
00:05:50,104 --> 00:05:51,360
What are you standing there for?

58
00:05:52,399 --> 00:05:53,360
Hurry and catch up.

59
00:05:57,780 --> 00:06:01,980
(Beyond Doubt, Steadfast in Virtue)

60
00:06:01,980 --> 00:06:11,100
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

61
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:16,000
Why did Young Master change his clothes?

62
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:19,240
He was dressed quite lavishly earlier.

63
00:06:20,008 --> 00:06:22,480
Young Master must have heard what Young Madam said

64
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,752
and changed specially for her.

65
00:06:30,808 --> 00:06:32,190
Did you sleep well last night?

66
00:06:35,416 --> 00:06:37,000
Is there anything you'd like for lunch?

67
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:43,160
Don't be nervous.

68
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:45,528
You're only paying respects to the elders of the family.

69
00:06:45,832 --> 00:06:47,560
No one will make things difficult for you.

70
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,600
I'm not nervous.

71
00:06:49,048 --> 00:06:51,240
The imperial edict is still kept in the family shrine.

72
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,360
Exactly.

73
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:57,160
You're the wife I pleaded so hard to marry.

74
00:06:57,848 --> 00:06:59,672
If anyone dares make things difficult for you,

75
00:06:59,768 --> 00:07:01,800
at the very least, that would be disrespecting me.

76
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:02,600
More seriously,

77
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,439
it would be disrespecting His Majesty himself.

78
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:09,040
Young Master Lin, I just realized

79
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,519
you really are shameless.

80
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,399
Exactly.

81
00:07:14,519 --> 00:07:16,319
The sea winds in Jinzhou were so strong

82
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,639
that after a few years, they thickened my skin.

83
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,240
It's all right.

84
00:07:20,392 --> 00:07:21,720
We're married now anyway.

85
00:07:21,730 --> 00:07:23,300
You can help me take care of it, my lady.

86
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:24,330
Give it a couple of years,

87
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,680
and maybe it'll get thin again.

88
00:07:32,216 --> 00:07:34,344
You lived in the capital when you were little, right?

89
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,160
The capital is colder than Jinling.

90
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:40,040
When it snows there, the flakes are as big as goose feathers.

91
00:07:40,552 --> 00:07:41,310
Have you seen it?

92
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,560
It gets freezing cold there.

93
00:07:43,592 --> 00:07:45,464
You'd have to wear two or three padded coats.

94
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:01,340
(Upholding the Virtue of Generations Past)

95
00:08:02,199 --> 00:08:03,800
Young Master and Young Madam are here.

96
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,000
I pay my respects to you, Old Master,

97
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,079
Old Madam,

98
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,759
and all the other elders.

99
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,799
Even if she comes from a humble family,

100
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:03,559
she should still know proper etiquette

101
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,159
and how to address her elders.

102
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:12,720
Old Madam.

103
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,360
What you don't know, Old Madam,

104
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:16,960
is that it's fashionable in Jinling City nowadays

105
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,720
for a new bride to say nothing when paying her respects.

106
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,639
Is that really so?

107
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:23,519
Yes.

108
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:25,000
They say

109
00:09:25,399 --> 00:09:27,440
the less a new bride speaks,

110
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,919
the more prosperous her husband's family will be.

111
00:09:33,879 --> 00:09:34,879
I see.

112
00:09:43,879 --> 00:09:45,440
Young Madam got up before dawn

113
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,679
to make this fish soup.

114
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,720
Grandfather,

115
00:10:31,192 --> 00:10:33,176
please try your granddaughter-in-law's cooking.

116
00:11:27,559 --> 00:11:28,639
Lanxiang,

117
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:32,120
the Lin family is a scholarly household,

118
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:36,039
and you are the wife of our eldest grandson.

119
00:11:37,399 --> 00:11:38,720
(Their Lin family)

120
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:40,559
(is a distinguished clan in Jiangnan.)

121
00:11:40,792 --> 00:11:42,504
(If you marry into the family,)

122
00:11:42,679 --> 00:11:44,320
(you must serve your parents-in-law.)

123
00:11:44,424 --> 00:11:46,952
(You won't have the same freedom you had before marriage.)

124
00:11:47,279 --> 00:11:49,480
Seek guidance from your elders.

125
00:11:50,039 --> 00:11:52,000
Don't act on your own

126
00:11:52,408 --> 00:11:54,200
and upset the rules of the household.

127
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,320
(Whether you marry sooner or later,)

128
00:11:57,704 --> 00:11:59,870
(the Shen family will always be there for you.)

129
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:11,440
(Does the Lin family intend to break off the engagement?)

130
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:13,159
(The Lin family has gone too far!)

131
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,910
Taking this opportunity today,

132
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,759
I also have something

133
00:12:25,944 --> 00:12:27,360
to report to Grandfather

134
00:12:27,879 --> 00:12:28,960
and all the elders.

135
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:33,279
His Majesty is currently in need of capable men by his side

136
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:35,600
and intends to transfer me to the capital.

137
00:12:36,024 --> 00:12:37,390
Since I've only recently married,

138
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:40,559
I had hoped to stay a little longer

139
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,200
so my wife could also

140
00:12:42,312 --> 00:12:44,536
spend more time showing her devotion to the elders.

141
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:47,759
But the canal will freeze over by the end of November,

142
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:50,320
and the cold has come especially early this year.

143
00:12:50,679 --> 00:12:52,960
So I have no choice but to leave ahead of schedule

144
00:12:53,032 --> 00:12:54,552
to take up my post in the capital.

145
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:56,000
You're going to the capital?

146
00:12:56,568 --> 00:12:58,320
Going to the capital is a good thing.

147
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:02,200
His Majesty intends to entrust you with important duties.

148
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,799
Good.

149
00:13:03,799 --> 00:13:06,000
Our Lin family is finally on the rise.

150
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,120
Do you have to rush to the capital right now?

151
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,279
Why not wait until after the Chinese New Year

152
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:18,320
and leave when the weather warms up?

153
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:22,679
You women are always so short-sighted.

154
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,360
The capital is where the Emperor resides.

155
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,480
Countless people would do anything

156
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,159
to get in, yet never get the chance.

157
00:13:31,519 --> 00:13:33,279
You're talking about yourself, aren't you?

158
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:34,600
Changmin.

159
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,919
Don't provoke me today.

160
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:38,320
How did I provoke you?

161
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,080
That's enough.

162
00:13:39,279 --> 00:13:40,919
What do you mean by that?

163
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:47,759
Are you planning

164
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:50,759
to take your wife to the capital with you?

165
00:13:52,504 --> 00:13:54,056
Judging by His Majesty's intentions,

166
00:13:54,376 --> 00:13:56,390
I'm afraid I won't be back for two or three years.

167
00:13:58,519 --> 00:14:00,759
Of course I'll take my wife with me

168
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,360
so we can look after each other.

169
00:14:23,759 --> 00:14:26,240
Why does Old Master look unhappy?

170
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,879
What nonsense are you talking about?

171
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,799
Old Master is simply too happy

172
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,399
to find the words.

173
00:14:34,159 --> 00:14:35,600
What do you know?

174
00:14:35,864 --> 00:14:37,870
If he wants to become an important court official

175
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,720
and one of His Majesty's trusted men,

176
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:43,399
he must first enter the imperial court and be close to His Majesty.

177
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:44,200
But right now,

178
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:48,120
where are the imperial court and His Majesty? In the capital.

179
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:52,399
Jinqi, what are you still standing there for?

180
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,480
Hurry and pack your things

181
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,176
and get ready to leave for the capital.

182
00:14:56,679 --> 00:14:57,360
Yes.

183
00:15:15,919 --> 00:15:17,600
There's no need to unpack the dowry.

184
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:19,559
We can take it straight to the capital.

185
00:15:22,792 --> 00:15:24,550
His Majesty summoned you to the capital,

186
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:25,799
not me.

187
00:15:26,519 --> 00:15:27,480
I'll stay in Jinling

188
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:29,559
to care for our parents and serve the elders.

189
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,600
I'm going to the capital

190
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,159
not only for my official career,

191
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,519
but also for you.

192
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,559
Don't try to sweet-talk me.

193
00:15:48,159 --> 00:15:49,600
I'm not even in the capital,

194
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,944
so there's no need for you to go there for my sake.

195
00:15:54,519 --> 00:15:56,600
Now that we're husband and wife,

196
00:15:56,664 --> 00:15:58,150
we'll share both fortune and hardship.

197
00:15:59,159 --> 00:16:01,159
So I'll be completely frank with you.

198
00:16:02,559 --> 00:16:04,960
Old Madam, Father, and Uncle Changmin

199
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:07,000
are all unreasonable and muddleheaded.

200
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,399
Grandfather and Mother

201
00:16:10,879 --> 00:16:11,799
are shrewd,

202
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,519
but in recent years,

203
00:16:13,544 --> 00:16:15,304
they've become increasingly difficult too.

204
00:16:15,528 --> 00:16:18,670
Aunt Lingxiao is clever in small matters but foolish about important ones.

205
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,399
She's as close to Mother as a sister.

206
00:16:21,032 --> 00:16:22,870
When Mother strikes, she hands her the rod.

207
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:25,208
All she does is fan the flames and make things worse.

208
00:16:26,759 --> 00:16:29,080
You saw what happened this morning.

209
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,759
Because of our marriage,

210
00:16:30,824 --> 00:16:33,000
they're all harboring a great deal of resentment.

211
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,320
I'm out from morning till night,

212
00:16:35,330 --> 00:16:37,100
so they can't make things difficult for me.

213
00:16:37,256 --> 00:16:38,750
But you'll be here in the residence.

214
00:16:39,336 --> 00:16:41,320
Even with the imperial edict to protect you,

215
00:16:41,528 --> 00:16:44,568
it can only protect you from what happens openly, not in secret.

216
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,159
Rather than endure their constant nagging here every day,

217
00:16:48,679 --> 00:16:50,159
we might as well leave altogether.

218
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:52,120
Out of sight, out of mind for them,

219
00:16:52,159 --> 00:16:53,440
and we'll be happier, too.

220
00:16:53,919 --> 00:16:55,080
After three or five years,

221
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,840
once we've settled into life in the capital,

222
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,399
their anger will have subsided, too.

223
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,480
You can go if you want.

224
00:17:01,919 --> 00:17:03,480
I'm not going to the capital anyway.

225
00:17:06,079 --> 00:17:08,319
You're worried about your parents, aren't you?

226
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,000
Don't worry.

227
00:17:10,359 --> 00:17:11,599
I'll make sure some friends

228
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:13,319
visit them every few days

229
00:17:13,319 --> 00:17:14,160
and look after them.

230
00:17:18,072 --> 00:17:19,680
Are you worried that in the capital,

231
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,496
you won't know anyone or your way around?

232
00:17:21,736 --> 00:17:23,384
Xiaolian, Yuchan, Gantang, and Baogai

233
00:17:23,432 --> 00:17:24,750
will come to the capital with us.

234
00:17:24,824 --> 00:17:26,296
Whoever you want, we'll bring along.

235
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,839
Is there someone you can't bear

236
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,279
to leave behind in Jinling City?

237
00:17:46,504 --> 00:17:49,592
Scholar Han will be taking the metropolitan examination next spring,

238
00:17:55,336 --> 00:17:56,920
so he'll be going to the capital, too.

239
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,400
What nonsense are you talking about?

240
00:18:07,224 --> 00:18:09,400
You've had a few years of schooling, at least.

241
00:18:09,432 --> 00:18:11,180
How did you sound just like a crude soldier,

242
00:18:11,192 --> 00:18:12,376
spouting such nonsense?

243
00:18:12,408 --> 00:18:14,160
Even if you don't care about my reputation,

244
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:15,680
you should at least care about his.

245
00:18:20,296 --> 00:18:22,000
My mother-in-law made these clothes for me?

246
00:18:22,536 --> 00:18:24,160
Why didn't you give them to me sooner?

247
00:18:27,519 --> 00:18:28,319
Give it back.

248
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:29,480
This was made for me.

249
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,240
Give it back.

250
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:31,720
Don't tear it.

251
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,599
Give it back to me.

252
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:33,800
Stop pulling. You'll ruin it!

253
00:18:54,100 --> 00:18:56,020
♪A faint trace of fragrance♪

254
00:18:56,020 --> 00:18:57,860
♪Softly lingers in the air♪

255
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,599
If there's no one else on your mind,

256
00:19:02,759 --> 00:19:04,160
then come to the capital with me.

257
00:19:05,624 --> 00:19:07,310
Why should I have to prove my innocence?

258
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:10,279
Believe whatever you want.

259
00:19:10,279 --> 00:19:11,359
But Young Master Lin,

260
00:19:11,624 --> 00:19:13,880
I may come from a humble family and be at your mercy,

261
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:16,590
but slandering an imperial official could land you in court.

262
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:20,100
♪Ooh, you fall into my heart♪

263
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:25,020
♪There are still many chapters ahead♪

264
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:28,140
♪Ooh, I can't forget♪

265
00:19:28,140 --> 00:19:29,980
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

266
00:19:29,980 --> 00:19:33,180
♪My longing lingers like the fragrance of orchids♪

267
00:19:34,180 --> 00:19:36,820
♪Ooh, I've walked through frost-covered streets far and wide♪

268
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:40,740
♪Ooh, I'm blessed to have you understand my tender heart♪

269
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,039
My lady.

270
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:45,839
My lady.

271
00:19:47,039 --> 00:19:48,000
I was wrong.

272
00:19:48,759 --> 00:19:50,240
I won't speak such nonsense again.

273
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:52,420
♪Love lingers all around us♪

274
00:19:53,580 --> 00:19:55,660
♪Holding hands through this life♪

275
00:19:55,660 --> 00:20:03,340
♪Breathing in the fragrance that fills the courtyard♪

276
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:48,559
Jinqiao's wedding is set for next May.

277
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,200
Originally, I thought

278
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:52,920
we'd wait until spring before going to the capital for the wedding.

279
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,759
But now,

280
00:20:54,759 --> 00:20:57,319
Jinqi happens to be going to the capital to take up his post.

281
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:58,559
So I thought

282
00:20:58,616 --> 00:21:00,440
they could travel to the capital together

283
00:21:01,039 --> 00:21:03,279
and look out for each other.

284
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,160
That works.

285
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,160
Make your preparations

286
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:12,319
and go to the capital with your brother.

287
00:21:13,039 --> 00:21:13,680
Yes.

288
00:21:15,519 --> 00:21:18,200
Jinqiao is still too playful. Just look at him.

289
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:20,559
He even fell off his horse while riding.

290
00:21:22,079 --> 00:21:25,240
His future wife is still young and can't handle much yet.

291
00:21:25,559 --> 00:21:26,559
So I thought

292
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:29,319
I'd accompany Jinqiao to the capital

293
00:21:30,056 --> 00:21:31,944
and make sure the wedding is properly arranged,

294
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:34,480
so both the Lin and Cheng families can hold their heads high.

295
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:38,559
All right.

296
00:21:39,079 --> 00:21:39,880
You may go.

297
00:21:41,319 --> 00:21:42,559
You're not young anymore.

298
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:44,376
It's time you took on some responsibility.

299
00:21:44,799 --> 00:21:47,039
Don't rely on your brother for everything.

300
00:21:47,599 --> 00:21:49,119
Take good care of your mother.

301
00:21:50,039 --> 00:21:52,160
I will remember your teachings, Grandfather.

302
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:05,359
Grand... Grandfather.

303
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,799
Well...

304
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,880
Xiuwan has been confined for over a year now.

305
00:22:10,030 --> 00:22:12,088
Keeping her locked away like this isn't a solution.

306
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,559
Mother was thinking

307
00:22:13,559 --> 00:22:15,359
of taking Xiuwan to the capital with us

308
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:17,759
and asking Aunt for help.

309
00:22:17,920 --> 00:22:19,799
Perhaps she can find her a suitable match.

310
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:23,599
Xiuwan truly knows she was wrong.

311
00:22:24,079 --> 00:22:26,000
Another year is nearly gone.

312
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,000
If this drags on any longer,

313
00:22:30,376 --> 00:22:32,440
she really won't be able to find a suitable match.

314
00:22:34,680 --> 00:22:36,440
You welcomed the bride in April,

315
00:22:36,799 --> 00:22:38,400
so you'll have to hurry back soon after.

316
00:22:39,119 --> 00:22:40,279
At most,

317
00:22:40,599 --> 00:22:43,319
you'll only be in the capital for five months,

318
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:46,319
and you'll have Jinqiao's wedding to prepare for.

319
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:49,559
How could you find her a good match in such a rush?

320
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:52,480
Stay home and behave yourself.

321
00:22:53,759 --> 00:22:54,839
Old Master,

322
00:22:55,079 --> 00:22:56,759
she's my only daughter.

323
00:22:56,808 --> 00:22:58,470
As long as things aren't settled for her,

324
00:22:58,559 --> 00:23:01,079
I won't have a day of peace.

325
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:04,200
Xiuwan has been confined for so long

326
00:23:04,210 --> 00:23:05,300
and has stayed in her room

327
00:23:05,310 --> 00:23:07,288
studying earnestly and reflecting on her mistakes.

328
00:23:08,200 --> 00:23:10,039
She truly knows she was wrong.

329
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,359
For the sake of

330
00:23:11,759 --> 00:23:14,079
how long she's been kneeling outside,

331
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:16,640
please let her go to the capital with us.

332
00:23:19,336 --> 00:23:20,000
Young Master.

333
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,599
Jinqi.

334
00:23:39,359 --> 00:23:41,079
Your Lordship, Third Young Lady.

335
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:09,000
Xiuwan.

336
00:24:21,279 --> 00:24:23,519
This is my second younger sister.

337
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:25,270
She's the most mischievous of us all

338
00:24:26,184 --> 00:24:28,120
and has been made to kneel by Grandfather again.

339
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:32,680
And this is my third brother-in-law.

340
00:24:35,544 --> 00:24:37,416
I hope you've been well this winter, Xiuwan.

341
00:25:02,376 --> 00:25:04,584
I hope you've been well this winter, Chengze.

342
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:15,559
It's freezing out here.

343
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:16,920
How can your knees

344
00:25:17,319 --> 00:25:18,559
take all this kneeling?

345
00:25:20,559 --> 00:25:21,559
I'm not foolish.

346
00:25:22,319 --> 00:25:23,920
I'm wearing wool knee pads.

347
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:29,319
You're with child.

348
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:32,119
Don't stand out here in the cold with me.

349
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:33,960
Hurry inside.

350
00:25:34,616 --> 00:25:36,936
And put in a good word for me while you're there.

351
00:25:43,048 --> 00:25:45,736
Young Master, Third Son-in-Law and Third Young Lady are here.

352
00:25:47,759 --> 00:25:48,519
Chengze.

353
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:52,039
Using me as an excuse again.

354
00:26:28,759 --> 00:26:29,720
Jinqi.

355
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:34,640
Is this the test you were talking about?

356
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:43,240
So have I passed your test?

357
00:26:46,519 --> 00:26:47,400
You have.

358
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:52,039
I'll take you to the capital.

359
00:26:53,320 --> 00:26:54,920
Whether or not we find you a match,

360
00:26:55,448 --> 00:26:57,030
you should broaden your horizons first.

361
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:59,440
Once you've seen more of the world,

362
00:27:00,008 --> 00:27:01,400
your world will naturally open up.

363
00:27:02,920 --> 00:27:04,359
Then you'll be able to put the past

364
00:27:05,039 --> 00:27:06,599
behind you like we have,

365
00:27:06,824 --> 00:27:09,224
instead of forcing yourself to act strong like you are now.

366
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:24,519
Wipe away your tears.

367
00:27:25,288 --> 00:27:26,480
Hold on a little longer.

368
00:27:27,048 --> 00:27:28,720
You won't have to kneel much longer.

369
00:27:29,848 --> 00:27:31,640
Thank you for your concern, Grandfather.

370
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:34,184
Mother has taken her medicine and isn't coughing anymore.

371
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,119
That's good.

372
00:27:37,519 --> 00:27:38,359
That's good.

373
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:44,839
Jinqi.

374
00:27:48,799 --> 00:27:49,400
Grandfather.

375
00:27:50,839 --> 00:27:52,400
Jinqiao and I have discussed it.

376
00:27:52,744 --> 00:27:54,400
Since we're both going to the capital,

377
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:55,359
we can also take

378
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:57,480
Aunt Lingxiao and Xiuwan to visit their family.

379
00:27:58,840 --> 00:28:00,920
Please give us your permission, Grandfather.

380
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:23,359
All right.

381
00:28:24,839 --> 00:28:26,440
If you travel together,

382
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:28,200
you can look out for one another.

383
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:31,519
Then you can all go to the capital together.

384
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:36,559
Thank you, Old Master.

385
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:40,880
Xiuwan.

386
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:44,039
Xiuwan!

387
00:28:44,039 --> 00:28:45,759
Your grandfather agreed. He agreed!

388
00:28:45,759 --> 00:28:46,519
Get up.

389
00:28:46,519 --> 00:28:48,039
Come on. Hurry, get up.

390
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:52,359
Here, slowly.

391
00:28:52,616 --> 00:28:54,550
You've been kneeling a long time, haven't you?

392
00:28:54,720 --> 00:28:55,759
Come on, let's go.

393
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:58,519
Let's go back and pack your clothes and jewelry.

394
00:28:59,759 --> 00:29:00,960
Once we reach the capital,

395
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:03,160
I'll make sure to find you a good match.

396
00:29:03,304 --> 00:29:05,400
The most important thing is that you're close in age

397
00:29:05,448 --> 00:29:06,960
and can be each other's first spouse.

398
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:08,000
Look at Xiuru.

399
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:10,480
What's so good about becoming someone's second wife?

400
00:29:10,520 --> 00:29:11,720
No matter how noble his status,

401
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:13,400
he's still an older widower

402
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:15,359
with a child.

403
00:29:15,360 --> 00:29:17,496
She has to become a mother the moment she marries him.

404
00:29:17,559 --> 00:29:19,500
If she does well, it's only considered her duty.

405
00:29:19,519 --> 00:29:21,319
If she doesn't, it'll all be her fault.

406
00:29:28,359 --> 00:29:29,279
What's wrong, Xiuwan?

407
00:29:33,519 --> 00:29:35,799
Xiuru and her husband have both let it go.

408
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:38,759
You should let it go too, Mother.

409
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:48,119
It's my fault.

410
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,599
I just saw Xiuru

411
00:29:57,319 --> 00:29:58,680
dressed in all her finery,

412
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,200
looking so radiant,

413
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:03,319
and your grandfather

414
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:06,400
treating her with such courtesy and respect.

415
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,759
I got petty again.

416
00:30:11,319 --> 00:30:13,440
I couldn't help feeling bitter.

417
00:30:15,784 --> 00:30:17,976
Think about it. Ever since you were little,

418
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:20,119
you were always the one who shone the brightest.

419
00:30:20,359 --> 00:30:21,799
When was it ever her turn?

420
00:30:26,079 --> 00:30:27,400
That's because I have you, Mother.

421
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,480
No matter how well Xiuru is married,

422
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:32,200
I'm not envious of her.

423
00:30:33,559 --> 00:30:35,200
I have a mother who loves me.

424
00:30:36,039 --> 00:30:37,119
That alone

425
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:40,359
is worth more than any good marriage.

426
00:30:47,039 --> 00:30:48,200
Silly girl.

427
00:30:51,559 --> 00:30:53,440
I can't take care of you forever.

428
00:30:56,319 --> 00:30:58,160
You'll have to marry someday.

429
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:01,039
Then I won't marry.

430
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:02,839
I'll stay by your side

431
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:04,720
and let you love me forever.

432
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,480
You... You're a grown lady now,

433
00:31:12,839 --> 00:31:14,440
yet you're still talking like a child.

434
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,200
Are you cold?

435
00:31:22,279 --> 00:31:22,839
No.

436
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:25,000
Let's go.

437
00:31:26,279 --> 00:31:26,680
Let's go.

438
00:31:30,799 --> 00:31:32,799
Think about which pretty clothes you want to bring

439
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:34,119
and pack them all up.

440
00:31:38,599 --> 00:31:40,440
It's still a little chilly.

441
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:43,599
I told you to put on another layer, but you wouldn't listen.

442
00:31:44,680 --> 00:31:45,440
It's all right.

443
00:31:46,400 --> 00:31:47,559
We'll be back soon anyway.

444
00:31:53,319 --> 00:31:54,640
Jinlan, Suhua.

445
00:31:57,144 --> 00:31:58,790
- Aunt Lingxiao. - Aunt Lingxiao.

446
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:00,184
- Xiuwan. - Xiuwan.

447
00:32:01,039 --> 00:32:02,400
It's freezing out here.

448
00:32:02,759 --> 00:32:05,119
You know Jinlan is frail and shouldn't be out in the cold,

449
00:32:05,208 --> 00:32:07,030
yet you still let him wander around outside.

450
00:32:08,039 --> 00:32:09,279
If he falls ill,

451
00:32:09,519 --> 00:32:11,920
I'd like to see how you explain it to Master and First Madam.

452
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:14,920
Jinqi and I agreed

453
00:32:15,016 --> 00:32:16,480
to pay our respects to Grandfather.

454
00:32:17,192 --> 00:32:19,200
She was worried about me, so she followed me out.

455
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,559
Jinlan isn't a child anymore.

456
00:32:21,592 --> 00:32:24,536
What does his coming out for a stroll have to do with Sister-in-Law?

457
00:32:25,079 --> 00:32:26,000
Besides,

458
00:32:26,200 --> 00:32:28,359
look how warmly she's dressed Jinlan.

459
00:32:28,360 --> 00:32:31,064
He's not going to fall ill from a little wind that easily.

460
00:32:32,640 --> 00:32:33,960
I can't win an argument with you.

461
00:32:34,799 --> 00:32:35,880
I'm done talking to you.

462
00:32:42,744 --> 00:32:44,856
Grandfather agreed to let you go to the capital?

463
00:32:48,519 --> 00:32:50,079
What are you waiting for? Hurry up.

464
00:32:50,559 --> 00:32:51,359
Coming.

465
00:32:53,440 --> 00:32:55,160
Jinlan, go on.

466
00:32:56,070 --> 00:32:58,376
With Jinqi, Xiuru, and her husband's help,

467
00:32:58,408 --> 00:33:01,720
I'm sure you'll get your wish and be able to take Sister-in-Law

468
00:33:01,720 --> 00:33:02,759
to the capital with you.

469
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:15,599
What?

470
00:33:16,079 --> 00:33:18,160
You're planning to take Jinlan and his wife

471
00:33:18,279 --> 00:33:20,000
to the capital too?

472
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:21,920
Ever since he was little,

473
00:33:22,119 --> 00:33:23,480
Jinlan has never left Jinling.

474
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:24,960
He's read countless books,

475
00:33:25,064 --> 00:33:26,984
but never had the chance to see the world.

476
00:33:27,048 --> 00:33:28,720
He's bound to have regrets about that.

477
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:33,976
Traveling across the great mountains and rivers is out of the question,

478
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:35,640
but the capital

479
00:33:35,688 --> 00:33:37,688
is somewhere he should see at least once.

480
00:33:38,696 --> 00:33:40,640
Now that he'll have elders traveling with him

481
00:33:40,839 --> 00:33:42,160
and his brothers by his side,

482
00:33:42,360 --> 00:33:44,664
it's the perfect chance for him to see more of the world.

483
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:50,279
With his health, as long as he stays alive

484
00:33:50,680 --> 00:33:52,480
and has a child or two,

485
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:53,599
that's enough.

486
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:54,759
This family

487
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:57,559
doesn't need him to broaden his horizons.

488
00:34:00,400 --> 00:34:01,119
Jinlan

489
00:34:02,440 --> 00:34:03,599
needs it for himself.

490
00:34:18,199 --> 00:34:19,559
Jinlan takes after Grandfather.

491
00:34:19,640 --> 00:34:21,030
He's intelligent and eager to learn.

492
00:34:21,640 --> 00:34:23,710
If his health hadn't kept him confined at home,

493
00:34:23,760 --> 00:34:25,896
he surely would have accomplished great things, too.

494
00:34:26,280 --> 00:34:27,320
For a man,

495
00:34:27,368 --> 00:34:28,760
sometimes keeping one's spirit alive

496
00:34:29,119 --> 00:34:30,679
matters more than merely staying alive.

497
00:34:35,000 --> 00:34:35,599
Grandfather.

498
00:34:36,168 --> 00:34:38,472
There are many renowned physicians in the capital.

499
00:34:38,664 --> 00:34:40,190
I was thinking that on this trip,

500
00:34:40,264 --> 00:34:42,104
we could also seek medical treatment for him.

501
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:44,760
Perhaps this could be a turning point for Jinlan

502
00:34:45,039 --> 00:34:46,280
and his health might improve.

503
00:34:47,519 --> 00:34:48,599
Jinqi is right.

504
00:34:49,239 --> 00:34:50,480
Once Jinqi takes up his post,

505
00:34:50,510 --> 00:34:52,250
I'll go with Jinlan to see the physicians.

506
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:53,880
Don't worry, Grandfather.

507
00:34:54,039 --> 00:34:55,920
We'll make sure Jinlan is well taken care of.

508
00:35:02,440 --> 00:35:05,208
Second Young Master and Second Young Madam are here.

509
00:35:10,280 --> 00:35:11,440
- Grandfather. - Grandfather.

510
00:35:28,079 --> 00:35:29,599
I can see what's going on now.

511
00:35:29,760 --> 00:35:32,519
You brothers planned this long ago

512
00:35:32,760 --> 00:35:34,960
and already made up your minds, didn't you?

513
00:35:41,159 --> 00:35:42,639
Nothing escapes you, Grandfather.

514
00:35:47,559 --> 00:35:48,880
I'm an only son.

515
00:35:49,519 --> 00:35:50,480
I truly envy them.

516
00:35:50,824 --> 00:35:53,150
The sisters are close, and the brothers stand together.

517
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:57,199
Now that we're all family,

518
00:35:57,440 --> 00:35:59,199
you're their brother, too.

519
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:01,400
You're right, Grandfather.

520
00:36:02,519 --> 00:36:03,199
Grandfather.

521
00:36:03,599 --> 00:36:05,480
Does that mean you'll let Jinlan come with us?

522
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:12,639
Go.

523
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,199
With all of you gone,

524
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:18,079
we'll enjoy some peace and quiet.

525
00:36:25,016 --> 00:36:27,272
- Thank you, Grandfather. - Thank you, Grandfather.

526
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:32,039
Jinqi, this is wonderful!

527
00:36:47,030 --> 00:36:47,784
Come, take a look!

528
00:36:47,816 --> 00:36:50,320
Silk flowers from the capital! Young Lady, come have a look.

529
00:36:50,392 --> 00:36:52,104
Even the ladies of the palace love them.

530
00:36:55,256 --> 00:36:56,168
Young Lady...

531
00:36:57,760 --> 00:36:58,360
Here.

532
00:37:12,679 --> 00:37:13,719
This one is pretty.

533
00:37:15,368 --> 00:37:16,760
Or does this one look better?

534
00:37:18,800 --> 00:37:20,679
Look at me.

535
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,400
Then it's settled. I'll

536
00:37:27,519 --> 00:37:29,559
(Ling Silk Shop) ask a matchmaker to visit your family.

537
00:37:29,559 --> 00:37:30,440
Good.

538
00:37:36,519 --> 00:37:38,519
Isn't that your son, Lin Jiugao?

539
00:37:38,520 --> 00:37:39,912
You're not looking at me, are you?

540
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:42,760
Go.

541
00:37:46,639 --> 00:37:47,880
Hurry and look. Isn't that him?

542
00:37:48,559 --> 00:37:48,960
No.

543
00:37:49,519 --> 00:37:51,840
Absolutely not. You've got the wrong person. Let's go.

544
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,639
How... How could that not be him?

545
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:57,000
Lin Jiugao?

546
00:37:59,599 --> 00:38:02,880
Auntie...

547
00:38:05,352 --> 00:38:06,400
Come with me. Let's go.

548
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:08,000
Please, don't be angry.

549
00:38:08,599 --> 00:38:10,000
Wu Suan'er!

550
00:38:10,199 --> 00:38:11,760
I must've been blind

551
00:38:11,760 --> 00:38:13,599
to ever associate with a scoundrel like you!

552
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:15,800
Listen, that little rascal

553
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:17,679
is full of tricks.

554
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:19,119
He... He must be

555
00:38:19,119 --> 00:38:20,800
putting on another act to fool people.

556
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:22,480
Don't even think about fooling us.

557
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:24,519
With a son like yours,

558
00:38:24,550 --> 00:38:26,808
don't let him ruin some innocent young lady's life.

559
00:38:27,719 --> 00:38:29,760
Come on, girl. Let's go.

560
00:38:29,920 --> 00:38:32,079
Sister! Wait!

561
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:49,800
Neither of you is any good.

562
00:38:51,519 --> 00:38:52,800
Neither of you.

563
00:39:07,039 --> 00:39:08,039
Since we're already here,

564
00:39:08,679 --> 00:39:10,840
I'll pick out a couple of silk flowers for Yuchan.

565
00:39:12,719 --> 00:39:14,119
If you want to marry Yuchan,

566
00:39:14,199 --> 00:39:15,360
just tell Madam Wu directly.

567
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:17,000
Why deliberately make your mother angry?

568
00:39:17,639 --> 00:39:19,280
My mother has very high expectations.

569
00:39:19,600 --> 00:39:22,630
She thinks that since I started serving Young Master, my prospects have changed

570
00:39:22,648 --> 00:39:24,190
and I have a bright future ahead of me.

571
00:39:24,720 --> 00:39:27,096
She's only been looking at girls from free commoner families

572
00:39:27,100 --> 00:39:28,890
and won't even consider military households.

573
00:39:29,016 --> 00:39:32,040
Then why not ask Young Master to seek an imperial marriage decree for you?

574
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:34,280
I originally

575
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,199
had the same idea.

576
00:39:36,488 --> 00:39:38,360
I'm sure Young Master would gladly help.

577
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:44,559
But...

578
00:39:52,008 --> 00:39:53,352
You weren't there when everyone

579
00:39:53,800 --> 00:39:55,560
went to have some fun with the newlyweds.

580
00:39:56,679 --> 00:39:58,639
You didn't see Young Madam hit Young Master.

581
00:39:58,808 --> 00:40:00,856
I don't know if it knocked any sense into him,

582
00:40:01,032 --> 00:40:02,840
but it certainly knocked some sense into me.

583
00:40:03,688 --> 00:40:06,630
I know full well my mother doesn't want Yuchan as her daughter-in-law.

584
00:40:07,079 --> 00:40:08,599
If I insist on marrying her anyway,

585
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,840
they'll never get along,

586
00:40:10,936 --> 00:40:13,000
and Yuchan will constantly be caught in the middle.

587
00:40:13,112 --> 00:40:14,824
Why would I put her through that?

588
00:40:17,599 --> 00:40:18,119
All right.

589
00:40:18,480 --> 00:40:19,000
Thank you.

590
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:19,639
Take care.

591
00:40:21,239 --> 00:40:22,000
We're off.

592
00:40:24,600 --> 00:40:25,800
Since you've already given up,

593
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:26,880
why put on that whole act?

594
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:29,400
Who says I've given up?

595
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:33,360
I'm planning to hold out against my mother to the very end.

596
00:40:36,239 --> 00:40:37,639
Is this a man or a woman?

597
00:40:38,559 --> 00:40:39,480
Here in Jinling City,

598
00:40:39,560 --> 00:40:41,590
my mother can forget about finding me a wife now.

599
00:40:42,639 --> 00:40:43,960
Is this a man or a woman?

600
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:45,119
Looking like this...

601
00:40:46,159 --> 00:40:46,800
What's wrong?

602
00:40:53,599 --> 00:40:55,760
We're leaving for the capital soon. Don't worry.

603
00:40:57,039 --> 00:40:59,519
It doesn't matter if you can't find a wife in Jinling.

604
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:09,039
I went to such lengths to find him the perfect wife.

605
00:41:09,280 --> 00:41:10,599
I had everything all settled,

606
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:12,440
with the prize practically in my hands,

607
00:41:13,039 --> 00:41:14,840
and just like that,

608
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:16,856
it slipped right through my fingers

609
00:41:16,904 --> 00:41:19,510
before my very eyes.

610
00:41:24,199 --> 00:41:27,039
Who did I go to all that trouble for?

611
00:41:28,039 --> 00:41:30,360
Not only does he not appreciate it at all,

612
00:41:30,639 --> 00:41:32,199
but he's also full of schemes

613
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:34,360
and uses every one of them to fool me.

614
00:41:35,400 --> 00:41:39,079
He has no idea how much I'm suffering inside.

615
00:41:42,320 --> 00:41:44,000
I've always prided myself on being strong,

616
00:41:45,199 --> 00:41:46,920
yet I've become a laughingstock,

617
00:41:47,760 --> 00:41:49,800
with people gossiping about me.

618
00:41:50,559 --> 00:41:52,119
The old saying is right.

619
00:41:53,039 --> 00:41:54,079
A mother's heart

620
00:41:54,559 --> 00:41:55,800
is always with her child,

621
00:41:56,079 --> 00:41:57,440
but her child's heart

622
00:41:58,039 --> 00:41:59,360
is as cold as stone.

623
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:08,559
A mother can't control her grown son.

624
00:42:09,840 --> 00:42:12,400
Try to look on the bright side.

625
00:42:13,519 --> 00:42:14,280
Jiugao

626
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:17,039
just doesn't want to marry.

627
00:42:17,880 --> 00:42:18,599
At least

628
00:42:18,984 --> 00:42:21,190
he hasn't brought some unreliable person into the family

629
00:42:21,440 --> 00:42:24,199
to stand before you every day and make your life miserable.

630
00:42:24,599 --> 00:42:25,559
First Madam is busy,

631
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,679
so I won't go in.

632
00:42:29,440 --> 00:42:30,320
I'm fine now.

633
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:32,119
Don't let it weigh on you.

634
00:42:33,239 --> 00:42:33,960
Don't.

635
00:42:34,119 --> 00:42:35,199
Lanxiang. Lan...

636
00:42:35,199 --> 00:42:35,760
All right.

637
00:42:36,616 --> 00:42:39,190
Tell First Madam later that Young Madam came to pay her respects,

638
00:42:39,199 --> 00:42:41,140
but you stopped her and wouldn't even let her come near.

639
00:42:41,159 --> 00:42:41,639
Understood.

640
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:43,440
Lanxiang.

641
00:42:47,559 --> 00:42:48,360
Are you angry?

642
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:54,150
Mother was only saying a few things

643
00:42:54,150 --> 00:42:55,256
to Madam Wu in passing...

644
00:43:00,312 --> 00:43:01,784
Don't take them seriously.

645
00:43:05,220 --> 00:43:07,380
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

646
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:12,159
Are you cold, Young Master?

647
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:14,199
No.

648
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:20,480
Bring me the cloak.

649
00:43:21,239 --> 00:43:22,000
No need.

650
00:43:22,168 --> 00:43:24,600
Those of us trained in martial arts aren't afraid of the cold.

651
00:43:38,239 --> 00:43:39,239
Now that you mention it,

652
00:43:39,880 --> 00:43:41,239
I am feeling a little cold.

653
00:43:56,620 --> 00:44:00,740
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

654
00:44:03,580 --> 00:44:08,100
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

655
00:44:09,380 --> 00:44:13,300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

656
00:44:13,980 --> 00:44:16,740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

657
00:44:17,460 --> 00:44:19,780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

658
00:44:19,780 --> 00:44:22,860
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

659
00:44:24,380 --> 00:44:28,620
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

660
00:44:31,540 --> 00:44:35,700
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

661
00:44:37,500 --> 00:44:41,060
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

662
00:44:41,060 --> 00:44:44,620
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

663
00:44:45,420 --> 00:44:51,100
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

664
00:44:51,460 --> 00:44:55,780
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

665
00:44:56,140 --> 00:44:59,100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

666
00:44:59,100 --> 00:45:02,860
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

667
00:45:02,860 --> 00:45:05,740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

668
00:45:05,740 --> 00:45:09,820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

669
00:45:09,820 --> 00:45:13,180
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

670
00:45:13,180 --> 00:45:16,940
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

671
00:45:16,940 --> 00:45:20,940
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

